  "content": "\n\n<p>為部分 TenSura 頭目新增了建築結構，您不再需要依賴野外隨機生成來尋找它們。玩家可與「大師製圖師」村民交易，取得通往這些結構的地圖。</p>\n<p>所有結構均位於主世界（Overworld）。</p>\n<p>此附加模組需要以下前置模組：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tensura</li>\n<li>Tensura: Not Enough Bosses</li>\n</ul>\n<p>若您有更多建議，歡迎加入我們的 Discord 伺服器！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2634774a-82fb-4cb4-888b-b01b253ccc39.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"548\" height=\"386\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_66b4fdb4-a391-4ff9-b901-b08214c85e9f.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"653\" height=\"359\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_25339814-b00c-4bec-8aba-e5d85a3bb880.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"657\" height=\"352\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b9fbc2ae-a727-48b5-a515-e82e642eca7f.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"661\" height=\"386\"></p>",
